{{-- FUB creator terms v1. The sha3-256 of this rendered text is stored on chain at Publish (tosHash). Change = new hash. --}}
<ol class="fub-terms">
    <li>You own the art you upload, or you have the right to sell it as NFTs. Stolen or copied art gets your FUB hidden and suspended.</li>
    <li>No hate, harassment, sexual content involving minors, scams or illegal content. No text that impersonates Flovatar or anyone else.</li>
    <li>Publishing is final: published items, prices, supply rules and the layer order can never change. Your FUB building on your island is permanent.</li>
    <li>After publishing you can pause, resume or close minting, lower the royalty, change your payout address and add new items to free slots in existing layers.</li>
    <li>Every F.U.N. sale pays 95% to you and 5% to the Flovatar ecosystem (2.5% treasury, 2.5% burned).</li>
    <li>F.U.N. holders get the licence you chose for their F.U.N.; the art stays on chain.</li>
    <li>The Flovatar team may hide a FUB from flovatar.com or suspend it on chain after a report review. Nothing is ever deleted from the chain.</li>
</ol>
